# Lists: Marker image, for the whole list or for one item, with Alt and Height.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Language: en
	Title: Lists · Marker image
	Page:
		Paper: A4
		Margin: 20mm
	Section:
		Text: Lists
			Style: topic
		Heading 1:
			Text: Marker image
		Paragraph: With `Marker: image`, `Marker image` on the list gives the image of all its items, and on a `List item` it replaces it for that item. The image is as tall as the text unless it declares `Height`. With `Alt` a screen reader reads it, and without it the image is decorative.
			Style: intro
		Text: Marker image: documents/check.svg on the list, documents/cross.svg on the last item
			Style: label
		List:
			Marker: image
			Marker image: documents/check.svg
				Alt: Included
			List item:
				Paragraph: Compulsory third-party liability.
			List item:
				Paragraph: Roadside assistance.
			List item:
				Marker image: documents/cross.svg
					Alt: Excluded
				Paragraph: Own damage to the vehicle.
		Text: Marker image with Height: 7, decorative (no Alt)
			Style: label
		List:
			Marker: image
			Marker image: documents/star.svg
				Height: 7
			List item:
				Paragraph: A small star before each item.
			List item:
				Paragraph: It does not carry a meaning, so it has no Alt.
		Text: Marker image with Height: 18 in a list with Padding: 0 0 0 28
			Style: label
		List:
			Marker: image
			Box:
				Padding: 0 0 0 28
			Marker image: documents/star.svg
				Alt: Featured
				Height: 18
			List item:
				Paragraph: A larger marker, centered on the capitals of the first line.
